      'Create the variables: Check_Answers and Try_Again (True/False, default False), plus Score, Total_Percentage and CorrectItems (Number). ReorderCount is optional.',
      '"Check answers" button: Set Check_Answers = True. "Try again" button: Set Try_Again = True.',
      'Paste the whole code into an "Execute JavaScript" trigger on the slide\'s "Timeline Starts".',
      'Per-item feedback (optional): Text variables named Item_1, Item_2 ... get Right or Wrong after checking.',
      'Hide/show: call RS_hide(); before opening a popup or layer over the items and RS_show(); after it closes, from an "Execute JavaScript" trigger.',
